2026-05-15T11:30Z GBPCHF SMA50-cross research: two pre-registered hypotheses, both rejected. H1 (range-conditioned continuation) — unconditional 5-min cross cont rate 45.8% (below 50% baseline), correlation cross_range × signed_followthru = -0.048, MFE/MAE symmetric below cost floor. H2 (trend-flip filter bars_since_last_cross>=24) — N=3,410, cont rate 43.8% (further FROM 50%, anti-continuation strengthens), MFE/MAE worse. Real structural finding: persistent ~44-46% cont rate across 8 years = mild mean-reversion at cross. Below 2-pip RT cost so not tradeable as direct edge. Kept: scripts (v11/backtest/gbpchf_sma_cross_research.py, gbpchf_sma_cross_trendflip.py), event dump (v11/backtest/results/gbpchf_sma_crosses.csv, 20,564 events), downloader (v11/backtest/download_gbpchf_sequential.py), and 3.6M rows of GBPCHF MID/BID/ASK in tick_vault_data/fx/. Full journal: docs/journal/2026-05-15_gbpchf_sma50_cross_research.md.
